{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 49, :comments ["<b>You shall not count, etc. — you shall not take.</b> Meaning, whether by means of the atonement ransom or not by means of the atonement ransom. And see what I explained in the portion of Ki Tisa." "<b>Further,</b> it intends to say that even if a number of chieftainship and excellence comes to your hand — which is the number of the banners — even so <b>you shall not take.</b>"], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:05:47.900243392Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}